{"name":"Rinse","hex":"#d5d9dd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"rinse","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To wash (something) quickly using water and no soap.","To remove soap from (something) using water."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The action of rinsing.","A liquid used to rinse, now particularly a hair dye."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rinse"}],"entries":[{"title":"Washing","blocks":[{"text":"Washing is a method of cleaning, usually with water and soap or detergent. Regularly washing and then rinsing both body and clothing is an essential part of good hygiene and health."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Woman_washing_hands.jpg/330px-Woman_washing_hands.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washing"},{"title":"Washing machine","blocks":[{"text":"A washing machine is a machine designed to launder clothing. The term is mostly applied to machines that use water. Other ways of doing laundry include dry cleaning and ultrasonic cleaning."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/LG_%EB%93%9C%EB%9F%BC%EC%84%B8%ED%83%81%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80_%EC%8B%9D%EA%B8%B0%EC%84%B8%EC%B2%99%EA%B8%B0%2C_%EC%98%81%EA%B5%AD%EC%84%9C_%EB%AC%BC%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9_%ED%9A%A8%EC%9C%A8_%EC%B5%9C%EC%9A%B0%EC%88%98_%EC%A0%9C%ED%92%88_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg/330px-LG_%EB%93%9C%EB%9F%BC%EC%84%B8%ED%83%81%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80_%EC%8B%9D%EA%B8%B0%EC%84%B8%EC%B2%99%EA%B8%B0%2C_%EC%98%81%EA%B5%AD%EC%84%9C_%EB%AC%BC%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9_%ED%9A%A8%EC%9C%A8_%EC%B5%9C%EC%9A%B0%EC%88%98_%EC%A0%9C%ED%92%88_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washing_machine"},{"title":"Rinse (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Rinse, Inc., is an American on-demand laundry and dry cleaning services company headquartered in San Francisco, California. The comp